---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Website privacy"
  description="How the Stocker website handles library searches and calculator inputs, and where to find the app’s separate privacy policy."
  ><div class="container text-page">
    <h1>Website privacy</h1><div class="prose">
      <p>Last updated: November 7, 2026.</p><h2>Searches and calculations</h2><p
      >
        The website's library search and calculators run in your browser. This
        version does not send the text you enter or your calculator inputs to
        Stocker, store them in an account, or set analytics or advertising
        cookies.
      </p><h2>Pages and hosting</h2><p>
        Loading a website necessarily sends a request to its host. Hosting and
        infrastructure providers may process technical connection information
        such as an IP address to serve and protect the site. Any production
        hosting configuration and additional analytics must be reflected here
        before they are introduced.
      </p><h2>External links</h2><p>
        Links to the App Store, company filings and other websites take you to
        services with their own privacy practices. A download button does not
        create a Stocker account on this website.
      </p><h2>The Stocker app</h2><p>
        The app has its own data practices, which are described in the <a
          href={SITE.privacy}>Stocker app privacy policy</a
        > and <a href={SITE.appStore}>App Store privacy information</a>. This
        website notice does not replace those documents.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div></SiteLayout
>
